# Destinations of the worker-sca registry tools (network: registry). Not
# enabled by default: rename this file to sca-registries.conf (or copy the
# lines you need) and restart the egress service to let the selected tools
# reach them. The tools run only when a scan profile selects them.
#
#   govulncheck        proxy.golang.org sum.golang.org vuln.go.dev storage.googleapis.com
#                      (proxy.golang.org redirects module downloads to Google Cloud
#                      Storage; without it modules fail with "Forbidden")
#   pip-audit          pypi.org
#   npm/yarn/pnpm audit registry.npmjs.org
#   Composer audit     packagist.org repo.packagist.org
#   Dependency-Check   nvd.nist.gov (data feeds) or services.nvd.nist.gov (NVD API key)
#   GuardDog           pypi.org files.pythonhosted.org registry.npmjs.org
acl sca_registries dstdomain proxy.golang.org sum.golang.org vuln.go.dev storage.googleapis.com pypi.org files.pythonhosted.org registry.npmjs.org packagist.org repo.packagist.org nvd.nist.gov services.nvd.nist.gov
http_access allow sca_registries
